      "seed": 553858043,
      "version": 663,
      "versionNonce": 420462933,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789895804446,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "why we need to used data modeling?\n    (i)Data Redundancy\n             -> you just increase the data size \n                name     product\n                rohan     xyz\n                rohan     qwe\n                rohan      zbc\n                in this case you just increase the data size\n    (ii)Query Performance\n    (iii)Scaliblity and Maintance\n            -> database have frequent changes so its very difficult\n                to maintain data if we dont using data modeling",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "why we need to used data modeling?\n    (i)Data Redundancy\n             -> you just increase the data size \n                name     product\n                rohan     xyz\n                rohan     qwe\n                rohan      zbc\n                in this case you just increase the data size\n    (ii)Query Performance\n    (iii)Scaliblity and Maintance\n            -> database have frequent changes so its very difficult\n                to maintain data if we dont using data modeling",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6Z9RIcWV6H0c-5pKyaw9H",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141.1640625,
      "y": 411.64453125,
      "width": 454.7835998535156,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 461703605,
      "version": 231,
      "versionNonce": 34140379,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789896034231,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What is DataModeling?\n    DataModeling is a technique to convert your data into\n    kind of organized structure.  \n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What is DataModeling?\n    DataModeling is a technique to convert your data into\n    kind of organized structure.  \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wuZgfKHXwR4T2o0rQn_J5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 90.5703125,
      "y": 504.7734375,
      "width": 551.66357421875,
      "height": 240,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1961887739,
      "version": 1006,
      "versionNonce": 1264164469,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789898435079,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Layers of DataModeling?\n    (i) Conceptual layer (requirement geathering)\n            -> In this layer your team leader communicate with client \n                and then they understand what they want and then they\n                they decide what we need to build\n            ->  In simple term they listen to clint then they understand \n                 what we need to build\n \n  (ii) Logical Layer\n            -> In this we can build Logic\n                Like:- Entity relationship\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Layers of DataModeling?\n    (i) Conceptual layer (requirement geathering)\n            -> In this layer your team leader communicate with client \n                and then they understand what they want and then they\n                they decide what we need to build\n            ->  In simple term they listen to clint then they understand \n                 what we need to build\n \n  (ii) Logical Layer\n            -> In this we can build Logic\n                Like:- Entity relationship\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
