      "text": "Candidate Key\n          \n        Student_id       email     name\n            101            abc       blabla\n            102           xyz       chacha\n            103           wxy       hahaha\n\nCandidate key means any column which can become\nthe primary key\n \nstudent_id and email --> candidate key",
